            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>On-device transcription uses a single model now, Whisper Turbo. The model chooser is gone from the home screen, which simply shows Start recording.</li>
<li>The home screen is titled &quot;Welcome&quot;.</li>
<li>The &quot;Delete account&quot; action was removed from Settings.</li>
<li>Trimmed the dead empty space below the last card in Settings (both the General and Advanced tabs).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
